This example adapts Pocket TTS by Kyutai:
https://github.com/kyutai-labs/pocket-tts
Reference implementation: pocket-tts 1.0.3 (model b6369a24).

The export model uses the streaming building blocks from ../phonon; see
../phonon/NOTICE for their attribution. Pocket's time normalization and basic
text preparation follow the Pocket TTS implementation. The upstream code is
